Third-party material and standards
----------------------------------

config/channel_broker/tr38901_tdl_v19.4.0.json transcribes the normalized
delays and powers of the TDL models of 3GPP TR 38.901 V19.4.0 (ETSI TR 138
901, Release 19), clause 7.7.2, and cites that source. The legacy EPA, EVA
and ETU delay/power tables in scripts/ocudu_channel_broker.py follow 3GPP
TS 36.101/36.104 Annex B. 3GPP specifications are (C) ETSI and the 3GPP
Organizational Partners; the numerical tables are reproduced for
interoperability.

scripts/radio_schedule_sha256.h is an independent implementation of SHA-256
as specified in NIST FIPS 180-4, whose constants it uses.

The optional GUI of scripts/ocudu_channel_broker.py imports GNU Radio and
PyQt5 at run time; neither is distributed with this repository.
